 <HI REND="ITALIC">judicabit populos cum justitia.</HI>  Gr.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn eujquvthti,</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">in
rectitudine.</HI></P> <P COM="0023">V\. 11.  <HI REND="ITALIC">non dereliquisti.</HI>  R. Rom. Ger.  <HI REND="ITALIC">non derelinquis.</HI> 
