evenisse notat Augustinus, cum in aliis libris
esset  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uiJwðn</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">filiis:</HI>  in aliis  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uJeivwn</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">porcina,</HI>  uti hodie in
Gr. legitur. Hebr. habet,  <HI REND="ITALIC">filiis.</HI></P> <P COM="0025">V\. 15.  <HI REND="ITALIC">in justitia apparebo conspectui tuo.</HI>  R. Rom. M.
