 <HI REND="ITALIC">Deus meus fortitudo mea.</HI></P></DIV1> <DIV1 SECOND=YES COM="0032"><HEAD COM="0032">EX PSALMO XLIII.</HEAD> <P COM="0032">V\. 3.  <HI REND="ITALIC">afflixisti populos.</HI>  A.  <HI REND="ITALIC">infirmasti populos.</HI></P> <P COM="0032">V\. 10.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et non egredieris Deus.</HI>  G. C.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et non progredieris.</HI> 
