quidam veteres libri,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajllavgmasin.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0032">V\. 22.  <HI REND="ITALIC">mortificamur.</HI>  R. Rom. Amb. G.  <HI REND="ITALIC">morte afficimur.</HI> 
