 <HI REND="ITALIC">ascendit in aeternum.</HI>  C.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ascendit in sempiternum.</HI></P></DIV1> <DIV1 SECOND=YES COM="0041"><HEAD COM="0041">EX PSALMO LXXIV.</HEAD> <P COM="0041">V\. 2.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Narrabimus.</HI>  A. juxta Gr.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Enarrabo.</HI>  R. Rom.
