Secundinus Arusianensis</HI> <NOTE N="17" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0381" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0381"></COL> Nonnulli Mss.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Secundianus.</HI>  Item aliqui,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Arusilianensis,</HI> 
